OL,3,GNEWSASex offender jailed after train
OL,4,Astation assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sexually assaulted a young
OL,7,Fwoman as she waited on a station
OL,8,Fplatform for a train home has been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FNeil Shorter, 56, paced up and down
OL,12,FNewbury station and they had a short
OL,13,Fconversation in which he asked for
OL,14,Fdirections before he sexually assaulted
OL,15,Fher in August 2024.
OL,17,FHis victim reported the assault to
OL,18,Fstation staff and Shorter was later
OL,19,Fidentified by police.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
